# accounts

The account service library.

## Look a user up

```rust
use accounts::users::fetch_user;

let ada = fetch_user(1).expect("known");
assert_eq!(ada.name(), "ada");
```

`fetch_user` returns `None` for an id the service does not know.
Use `fetch_users` to look up many ids at once; unknown ids are skipped.

